End-to-end healthcare analytics consulting project using BigQuery SQL, Python, predictive modeling, Tableau, and executive reporting to identify factors associated with 30-day hospital readmissions and opportunities for intervention.

Key Deliverables: 
- Executive Tableau Dashboard
- Python EDA & Statistical Analysis
- Predictive Modeling & Risk Stratification
- BigQuery SQL Data Quality & ETL
- Business Discovery & Requirements
- Executive Recommendations
- Final Consulting Report
- Executive Presentation
